OL,3,GNEWSAMusic venue hits out at new
OL,4,AFacebook subscription
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent music venue has said it
OL,7,Fwill "absolutely not" pay for a new
OL,8,Fsubscription service to promote its
OL,9,Fevents on Facebook.
OL,11,FMeta, which owns the platform as well
OL,12,Fas Instagram, has started a new
OL,13,Fsubscription called Meta One which
OL,14,Flimits the number of website links that
OL,15,Fcan be posted - any more than two -
OL,16,Funless a fee is paid.
OL,18,FJack Heffernan, marketing manager for
OL,19,FThe Robin in Bilston, said the venue
OL,20,Fwould have to pay #370 to keep posting
OL,21,Fas it currently does.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
